Lady S. took care of Metz after he was put under a terrible [[Curse of the Legendary Titans|curse]] due to his disturbing the [[Ring]] of [[Behemoth]]. {{source|Ladies' Choice}} She later broke her loyalty to Metz, warning Dante that Guggenheim was coming to give him a lecture on Metz' behalf, though she did so in good faith. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

After Metz's curse was broken, her station was changed. She later escorted [[Rassimov]] after he was arrested in the [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]]. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}

When the Huntik Foundation allied with the [[Casterwill family]] to fight [[the Betrayer]] and his [[Blood Spirals]], Lady S. was in a [[Scramjet]] next to Metz. During the fighting, she acted as a field medic, healing [[Lucas Casterwill]] and his team. {{source|Dante's Return}}
